<title>USA: Calton Inc Q4 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Calton Inc Q4 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>MANALAPAN, N.J. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.04     loss	 $0.13</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,011     loss	 3,455</p>
<p> Revs			40,949		   43,430</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	26,527		   26,371</p>
<p>		   Year</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.02     loss	 $0.12</p>
<p> Net profit		   453     loss	 3,138</p>
<p> Revs		     122,435		  180,843</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  26,491		   26,281</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year ended November 30.</p>
<p>1995 results included certain fourth quarter writedowns of inventories and charges related to the wind-down of the Chicago division and executive severence aggregating $3.9 million, partially offset by the collection of $890,000 from a note previously reserved.</p>
